### Get all creatures
GET http://localhost:8080/api/creatures



### Create creature
POST http://localhost:8080/api/creatures
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Stormfang",
  "species": "Sky Predator",
  "dangerLevel": 4,
  "condition": "WATCH",
  "status": "ACTIVE",
  "habitatId": 1
}

### Get creature by ID
GET http://localhost:8080/api/creatures/4

### Get creature by ID - not found
GET http://localhost:8080/api/creatures/999



### Delete creature (existing)
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/creatures/3

### Delete creature (not found)
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/creatures/999


###

### Rename creature - success
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/creatures/3/name
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Shadowfang"
}

### Rename creature - blank name, expect 400
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/creatures/3/name
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": ""
}

### Rename creature - not found, expect 404
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/creatures/999/name
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Ghostfang"
}

### Rename creature - duplicate in same habitat, expect 409
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/creatures/7/name
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Cloudsnap"
}

###
GET http://localhost:8080/api/creatures/3/observations

###
GET http://localhost:8080/api/feedings?time=23:59

